\newlabel{tab:step_c}{{5.3}{59}{Step C: distribution metrics between the frFFT density and the analytical Gaussian, computed at the $\approx 38$ active fine-grid points per trajectory. All finite metrics are exactly zero; the \texttt {nan} entries in the JS column are a numerical artefact of zero mass at boundary points and are interpreted as zero}{table.5.3}{}}
